  "historyNote": "#5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7208, eff 2-26-00; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; amd by #7578, eff 10-13-01; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; amd by #10205, eff 10-19-12; amd by #10494, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12347, eff 8-14-17; amd by #12922, eff 11-23-19; ss by #13406, eff 7-23-22; ss by #14280, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
